0,"Arabic, Sanaani Language (AYN)... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/ayn/,"Sanaani Arabic is a stable indigenous language of Yemen. It belongs to the Afro-Asiatic language family and is part of the Arabic macrolanguage. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.","Arabic, Sanaani",Afro-Asiatic
